{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Begin your journey to become a Grand Mage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a &quot;Stellar Witch,&quot; a sorcerer who harnesses the power of the stars.<br>To grow into a Grand Mage, you set off on a magical journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But someone is trying to stop you\u2014sending enemies to hinder your growth.<br>Dodge enemy attacks, defeat them, collect gold, and gather even stronger star powers to face enemies that become more and more powerful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Stellar Witch&quot;</strong> is a roguelike game combining inventory management and dodge-based action, where you embark on a journey as a star-wielding witch to become the Grand Mage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To stand against enemies that come to attack you, you must manage your strength wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory Management System</strong><br>Tiles are divided into five ranks: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic.<br>Each tile has a unique size, shape, ability, and adjacency effect. Place these tiles with strategy to maximalize their powers in battle.<br>Think about synergy between tiles and build your own battle layout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/24f3d7f6ce6ed6142bab85b124686a25.poster.avif?t=1752123828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/24f3d7f6ce6ed6142bab85b124686a25.webm?t=1752123828\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/24f3d7f6ce6ed6142bab85b124686a25.mp4?t=1752123828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grid-Based Dodge Action Combat</strong><br>In battle, you face off 1v1 against monsters.<br>Step on tiles to activate their abilities.<br>Use various powers such as attacks, defense, and debuffs to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/4407046f938a97715606536f8a3a4bf2.poster.avif?t=1752123828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/4407046f938a97715606536f8a3a4bf2.webm?t=1752123828\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/4407046f938a97715606536f8a3a4bf2.mp4?t=1752123828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822990?t=1752123828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822990?t=1752123828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/394ce0d6269abbd102a4b7620ae5465e71ae52d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752123828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/394ce0d6269abbd102a4b7620ae5465e71ae52d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752123828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Begin your journey to become a Grand Mage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a &quot;Stellar Witch,&quot; a sorcerer who harnesses the power of the stars.<br>To grow into a Grand Mage, you set off on a magical journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But someone is trying to stop you\u2014sending enemies to hinder your growth.<br>Dodge enemy attacks, defeat them, collect gold, and gather even stronger star powers to face enemies that become more and more powerful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Stellar Witch&quot;</strong> is a roguelike game combining inventory management and dodge-based action, where you embark on a journey as a star-wielding witch to become the Grand Mage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To stand against enemies that come to attack you, you must manage your strength wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory Management System</strong><br>Tiles are divided into five ranks: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic.<br>Each tile has a unique size, shape, ability, and adjacency effect. Place these tiles with strategy to maximalize their powers in battle.<br>Think about synergy between tiles and build your own battle layout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/24f3d7f6ce6ed6142bab85b124686a25.poster.avif?t=1752123828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/24f3d7f6ce6ed6142bab85b124686a25.webm?t=1752123828\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/24f3d7f6ce6ed6142bab85b124686a25.mp4?t=1752123828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grid-Based Dodge Action Combat</strong><br>In battle, you face off 1v1 against monsters.<br>Step on tiles to activate their abilities.<br>Use various powers such as attacks, defense, and debuffs to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822990/extras/4407046f938a97715606536f8a3a4bf2.poster.avif?t=1752123828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite